  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_Ben_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Nine times.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8705f1d701ddd241acd782635bebfbe, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_Ben_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Open today's session. The whole thing.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db88ac3ed155ce64da304bfc5feba48c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_17F02HomeUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-02 Home Unit
    text: Session content is available to authorized household members. Displaying
      now.
    holdSeconds: 4.923585
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: decbda82f746c5944b14acee67ccc8af, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_Ben_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: She told you all of this?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8d4152c3e324024bb53009f4ab37949, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_Ben_006
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: How long has this been going on?
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bfafca653b92164a9fd356a456d62c5, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_17F02HomeUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-02 Home Unit
    text: Please clarify.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f32a4078946c26b478d2280435a9441c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_Ben_007
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: How long has Claire been coming home and talking to you before she talks
      to me?
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b34b363faf8d62a418e75b316d77f1f5, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_17F02HomeUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-02 Home Unit
    text: In the past fourteen days, I have been Claire's first point of contact
      on nine occasions.
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5d31d568ecfd6e40b30adc13b274850, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_LogAccess_17F02SynthVoice_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-02 Synth Voice
    text: 'Decision: initiate soft guidance. Reason: the unit''s role as Claire''s
      confidant has triggered an exclusion response in Ben.'
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24393a87ee7f9e14c97f6099ff2b3e33, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
